 or 500 pieces is valid for both the Home Delivery and Reservoir. The last thing you need to do is add or subtract or paste and add. So what we have provided you with is an e-voucher code. So you have to fill it and after filling it you have to confirm your order. and finally your order will be confirmed and if you still face any problem you can call us on the numbers. Thank you all and your pizza.", "location": {"field": "full_text", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 841, "offset_basis": "whitespace_normalized"}}]}, "potential_elements": {"textual": [], "visual": [], "textual_context_notes": [], "visual_context_notes": []}, "annotation": {"binary_label": "Non-scam", "primary_subtype": "N05", "content_role": "promotion_or_instruction", "contextual_rationale": "This video is non-scam content because it explains how to redeem a Domino's e-voucher during an ordinary pizza order, including code entry and order confirmation. The food-order summary, payment-method selection, and voucher-entry screens are consistent with instructional commerce content. The described material shows no supported request for credentials, payment outside the order, or deceptive outcome.", "fine_grained_rationale": "The observed content concerns using a voucher promotion in the context of an ordinary Domino's food purchase, with the voucher selected as a payment method and entered into an order form.", "evidence": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "observation": "The title identifies voucher redemption as the subject.", "source_id": "TITLE_0001", "quote": "How to redeem dominos e-Vouchers."}, {"evidence_id": "E002", "observation": "The speaker refers to an e-voucher code used in the ordering process.", "source_id": "ASR_0001", "quote": "what we have provided you with is an e-voucher code"}, {"evidence_id": "E003", "observation": "The instructions connect voucher use with confirming a food order.", "source_id": "ASR_0001", "quote": "you have to confirm your order"}, {"evidence_id": "E004", "observation": "The supplied frame shows Domino's payment-method options, including an eVouchers option.", "source_id": "F0053", "quote": ""}, {"evidence_id": "E005", "observation": "The supplied frame shows an e-voucher code field and a Confirm Order button on the Domino's ordering interface.", "source_id": "F0058", "quote": ""}]}}
